<body><h1>Privacy policy</h1>
<p><strong>Operator:</strong> ${SITE_OWNER}, contact <a href="mailto:${SITE_CONTACT}">${SITE_CONTACT}</a>.</p>
<p>The ${BOT_PREFIX} Assistant is a private, internal tool. It processes data only for the operator's own accounts (mail, calendar, files) and only on the operator's instruction. No data of other people is collected beyond what those accounts already contain. Nothing is sold, shared or used for advertising.</p>
<p>Access tokens for connected accounts are stored on the operator's own server, encrypted at rest by the operating system's file permissions, and can be revoked at any time from the respective account settings (Google account permissions, Microsoft account privacy settings).</p>
<p>Messages exchanged with the bots are kept on the operator's server and deleted according to the operator's retention settings. Questions: <a href="mailto:${SITE_CONTACT}">${SITE_CONTACT}</a>.</p>
